### META
directory_path: install/_setup.sh/lib
description: Shared library functions for DINS setup
created: 2025-01-28
modified: 2025-01-28
status: active

### FILES
state.sh | State file management and MOTD handling per PART 6.1

### STATE_FUNCTIONS
setup_state_init | Initialize state directory and file
setup_state_set | Set state for a phase:step
setup_state_get | Get state for a phase:step
setup_state_is_completed | Check if step is completed
setup_state_phase_is_completed | Check if entire phase is completed
setup_state_get_last_completed_phase | Get last completed phase number
setup_state_clear_all | Clear all state (--from-beginning)
setup_state_is_fully_completed | Check if setup is fully done

### MOTD_FUNCTIONS
motd_add_reminder | Add DINS setup reminder to /etc/motd
motd_remove_reminder | Remove DINS reminder from /etc/motd

### HELPER_FUNCTIONS
run_step | Execute a step with state tracking
skip_step | Mark a step as skipped

### USAGE
Source this file in setup.sh:
  source "${SETUP_DIR}/lib/state.sh"

### NOTES
State file location: /var/lib/dins/setup_state (production)
MOTD handling is Raspberry-Pi-specific per PART 6.1.5
